      "text": "⚠️ A Armadilha do ->withPivot('flags'):",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚠️ A Armadilha do ->withPivot('flags'):",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "index": "at",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "7b0b591f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1025,
      "y": 595,
      "width": 424.79999999999995,
      "height": 140.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 88309,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 958831134,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791342495249,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Por padrão, o Eloquent carrega APENAS as duas chaves:\n`projeto_id` e `usuario_id`.\n\nPara acessar a coluna de status em runtime:\n$participante = $projeto->participantes->first();\n$statusInt = $participante->pivot->flags;\n\nSE ESQUECER ->withPivot('flags'):\n$participante->pivot->flags retornará NULL silenciosamente!",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Por padrão, o Eloquent carrega APENAS as duas chaves:\n`projeto_id` e `usuario_id`.\n\nPara acessar a coluna de status em runtime:\n$participante = $projeto->participantes->first();\n$statusInt = $participante->pivot->flags;\n\nSE ESQUECER ->withPivot('flags'):\n$participante->pivot->flags retornará NULL silenciosamente!",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "index": "au",
      "autoResize": true
    },
